{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>據知情人士透露，Anthropic PBC的首次公開招股（IPO）已經吸引到可供購買股票約六倍的認購，投資者對這宗有望成為有史以來規模最大股票發行交易的興趣愈發濃厚。公司提交的文件顯示，這家Claude AI模型開發商及其聯合創始人計劃通過IPO籌集至多644億美元，並通過非公開配售籌集260億美元。</p>\n<h2>最新資訊</h2>\n<h2>編輯精選</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>熱門評論</h3>\n<h3>相關文章</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<h3>Top 10</h3>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:56:42.156384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:38:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:56:29.622330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:12.620861+00:00","content_hash":"c87b168c1b662e6b16b1aecf8e26233aa3ab248e66de4c9be64cfef300a5d70a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:56:42.156384+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}